      "content": "it just feels like everyone is just waiting for me to \"get better\" so things can go back to normal, but they don't understand that \"normal\" is what's killing me. it feels like i'm just a burden to everyone around me and the world would just be more peaceful without me dragging everyone down with my sadness. doesn't that make sense? like, isn't there a kind of peace in just letting it go?",
